- retro-compiler

- new nga implementations

  - common lisp (sbcl)
  - scheme (chicken)
  - javascript (node)
  - java
  - kotlin
  - haskell (ghc)

- nga-c

  - add device range validation for i/o
  - add checks for file i/o operations
  - split string handling to a separate source file
  - split scripting interface to a separate source file
  - split nga core into separate nga_core.c
